WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.302 --> 00:00:03.710
(intriguing music)

00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:05.150
- [Narrator] Yabusame is an ancient ritual

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:08.483
that practices samurai-style
archery on horseback.

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:12.540
And for 850 years, one family

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:14.730
has been keeping this tradition alive

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:17.673
with one of the oldest
samurai schools in the world.

00:00:23.894 --> 00:00:26.930
(delicate music)

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:29.530
By day, Kiyomoto Ogosawara is a doctor

00:00:29.530 --> 00:00:31.490
working to find a cure for cancer.

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:34.430
But by night, he's a samurai instructor,

00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:36.953
a job that has been in his
family for generations.

00:00:36.953 --> 00:00:39.870
(foreign language)

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:04.330
The school teaches the manners

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.340
and fundamentals of how samurais moved.

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:09.573
Students learn how samurai stood,

00:01:10.670 --> 00:01:13.923
how they used the bow,
and how they walked.

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:17.930
But the most impressive
thing the school teaches

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:19.640
is a ritual that was at the center

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:22.440
of what it meant to be a true samurai:

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:25.073
drawing a bow and mounting a horse.

00:01:28.383 --> 00:01:31.300
(foreign language)

00:01:56.882 --> 00:01:58.250
There is a yearly festival

00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:01.530
for the best archers to
showcase their skills.

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:04.340
The course is about 240 meters long,

00:02:04.340 --> 00:02:06.670
and some wear classical hunting attire

00:02:06.670 --> 00:02:09.013
while shooting at fixed
targets on horseback.

00:02:10.805 --> 00:02:12.740
It's a way to help
showcase an important part

00:02:12.740 --> 00:02:16.003
of their culture, one they
hope is never forgotten.

00:02:17.888 --> 00:02:20.805
(foreign language)

